OL,3,GNEWSAFrustration over months of ongoing
OL,4,Asinkhole repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sinkhole has halted traffic in a busy
OL,7,Farea of Manchester causing months of
OL,8,Ffrustration for residents and
OL,9,Fcommuters.
OL,11,FPart of Alan Turing Way in east
OL,12,FManchester was closed in March and
OL,13,Fthere are no signs of it reopening any
OL,14,Ftime soon.
OL,16,FThe northbound section of the road
OL,17,Fbetween Ashton Old Road and Grey Mare
OL,18,FLane has been coned off with Manchester
OL,19,FCity Council conducting investigative
OL,20,Fworks that are yet to be completed.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
